{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3695/lemmadeck/.tmp/resume182-6-8a-n10-figure-context3695-FIRST/fig-24.context.json","text":"{\n  \"schema\": \"ld-s10y-image/context@1\",\n  \"book\": \"8a\",\n  \"edition\": \"modern-us-neutral\",\n  \"figure\": \"fig-24\",\n  \"authoritativeRule\": \"Modern-edition text is authoritative. The original PNG supplies visual structure only. Never use an answer key or derive answer annotations.\",\n  \"sourceImage\": {\n    \"path\": \".tmp/resume182-6-8a-n10-figure-context3695-FIRST/artifacts/8a/figures/fig-24.png\",\n    \"sha256\": \"bc88e91a7d714f7cb7b821aebb23daf9de6772ffe5786ca6368649c14c006fa2\",\n    \"width\": 591,\n    \"height\": 903\n  },\n  \"suggestedSize\": \"1024x1536\",\n  \"lessons\": [\n    {\n      \"lesson\": \"alg8-c2-s2-n10\",\n      \"title\": \"10. 二元不等式组\",\n      \"prose\": [\n        {\n          \"figureLabel\": \"图 24\",\n          \"nearbyText\": [\n            \"例2：考察不等式组：\\n$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant2x-3,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant2x+2\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\n它给出以直线$y=2x-3$和$y=2x+2$为边界的带形区域，包含两条边界直线（图24）。\",\n            \"例1：考察不等式组：\\n$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\leqslant0,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant0\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\n它给出第二象限及其在坐标轴上的边界，包含坐标原点（图23）。\",\n            \"图 23\",\n            \"图 24\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"exercises\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}
{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3695/lemmadeck/.tmp/resume182-6-8a-n10-figure-context3695-FIRST/artifacts/8a/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg8-c2-s2-n10/exercises.json","text":"{\n  \"lesson\": \"alg8-c2-s2-n10\",\n  \"count\": 7,\n  \"exercises\": [\n    {\n      \"number\": \"131\",\n      \"source_number\": \"131\",\n      \"group\": null,\n      \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n      \"text\": \"131. 下列变量$x$和$y$的取值数对$(x,y)$是不等式组$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}2x+3y&>-1,\\\\\\\\x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant2\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$的解吗？\\na) $(0,0)$；\\nb) $(-1,0.5)$；\\nc) $(1,-1)$；\\nd) $\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{3},1\\\\right)$。\",\n      \"lines\": [\n        \"131. 下列变量$x$和$y$的取值数对$(x,y)$是不等式组$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}2x+3y&>-1,\\\\\\\\x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant2\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$的解吗？\",\n        \"a) $(0,0)$；\",\n        \"b) $(-1,0.5)$；\",\n        \"c) $(1,-1)$；\",\n        \"d) $\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{3},1\\\\right)$。\"\n      ],\n      \"pages\": [\n        \"p0061#7\"\n      ],\n      \"figure_refs\": [],\n      \"figures\": [],\n      \"source_text\": \"131. 下列变量$x$和$y$的取值数对$(x,y)$是不等式组$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}2x+3y&>-1,\\\\\\\\x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant2\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$的解吗？а) $(0,0)$； б) $(-1,0.5)$； в) $(1,-1)$； г) $\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{3},1\\\\right)$.\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": \"132\",\n      \"source_number\": \"132\",\n      \"group\": null,\n      \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n      \"text\": \"132. $F$是由不等式组$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\leqslant x+4,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant x-4\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$给出的坐标平面上点的集合，下列各点属于集合$F$吗？\\na) $A(0,5)$；\\nb) $B(-1,3)$；\\nc) $C(-20,20)$；\\nd) $D(100,102)$。\",\n      \"lines\": [\n        \"132. $F$是由不等式组$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\leqslant x+4,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant x-4\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$给出的坐标平面上点的集合，下列各点属于集合$F$吗？\",\n        \"a) $A(0,5)$；\",\n        \"b) $B(-1,3)$；\",\n        \"c) $C(-20,20)$；\",\n        \"d) $D(100,102)$。\"\n      ],\n      \"pages\": [\n        \"p0061#8\"\n      ],\n      \"figure_refs\": [],\n      \"figures\": [],\n      \"source_text\": \"132. $F$是由不等式组$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\leqslant x+4,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant x-4\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$给出的坐标平面上点的集合，下列各点属于集合$F$吗？$A(0,5)$； $B(-1,3)$； $C(-20,20)$； $D(100,102)$.\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": \"133\",\n      \"source_number\": \"133\",\n      \"group\": null,\n      \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n      \"text\": \"133. 在坐标平面上画细线条表示下列各种点的集合：\\na) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\geqslant0,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\nb) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\geqslant2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant-1;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\nc) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}2&\\\\leqslant x<4.5,\\\\\\\\1&\\\\leqslant y\\\\leqslant5;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\nd) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}-1&<x<2,\\\\\\\\-4&<y<-1.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n      \"lines\": [\n        \"133. 在坐标平面上画细线条表示下列各种点的集合：\",\n        \"a) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\geqslant0,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n        \"b) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\geqslant2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant-1;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n        \"c) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}2&\\\\leqslant x<4.5,\\\\\\\\1&\\\\leqslant y\\\\leqslant5;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n        \"d) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}-1&<x<2,\\\\\\\\-4&<y<-1.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\"\n      ],\n      \"pages\": [\n        \"p0061#9\",\n        \"p0062#1\"\n      ],\n      \"figure_refs\": [],\n      \"figures\": [],\n      \"source_text\": \"133. 在坐标平面上画细线条表示下列各种点的集合：а) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\geqslant0,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$ б) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\geqslant2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant-1;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$в) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}2&\\\\leqslant x<4.5,\\\\\\\\1&\\\\leqslant y\\\\leqslant5;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$ г) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}-1&<x<2,\\\\\\\\-4&<y<-1.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": \"134\",\n      \"source_number\": \"134\",\n      \"group\": null,\n      \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n      \"text\": \"134. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示坐标满足下列不等式组的点的集合：\\na) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant2x+6,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant-2x+6;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\nb) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant x+2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant-x+2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant5;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\nc) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y-3x-6&\\\\leqslant0,\\\\\\\\2y-6x+3&\\\\geqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\nd) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x+y&\\\\leqslant2,\\\\\\\\y-x&\\\\leqslant2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant0.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n      \"lines\": [\n        \"134. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示坐标满足下列不等式组的点的集合：\",\n        \"a) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant2x+6,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant-2x+6;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n        \"b) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant x+2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant-x+2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant5;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n        \"c) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y-3x-6&\\\\leqslant0,\\\\\\\\2y-6x+3&\\\\geqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n        \"d) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x+y&\\\\leqslant2,\\\\\\\\y-x&\\\\leqslant2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant0.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\"\n      ],\n      \"pages\": [\n        \"p0062#2\"\n      ],\n      \"figure_refs\": [],\n      \"figures\": [],\n      \"source_text\": \"134. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示坐标满足下列不等式组的点的集合：а) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant2x+6,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant-2x+6;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$ б) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant x+2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant-x+2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant5;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$б) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y-3x-6&\\\\leqslant0,\\\\\\\\2y-6x+3&\\\\geqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$ г) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x+y&\\\\leqslant2,\\\\\\\\y-x&\\\\leqslant2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant0.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\",\n        \"math-correction\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": \"135\",\n      \"source_number\": \"135\",\n      \"group\": null,\n      \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n      \"text\": \"135. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示由下列不等式组给出的点的集合：\\na) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant0.64,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\nb) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\geqslant4,\\\\\\\\x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant16;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\nc) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant16,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant4-x;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\nd) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant x^2,\\\\\\\\y-4&\\\\leqslant0.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n      \"lines\": [\n        \"135. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示由下列不等式组给出的点的集合：\",\n        \"a) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant0.64,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n        \"b) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\geqslant4,\\\\\\\\x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant16;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n        \"c) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant16,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant4-x;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n        \"d) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant x^2,\\\\\\\\y-4&\\\\leqslant0.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\"\n      ],\n      \"pages\": [\n        \"p0062#3\"\n      ],\n      \"figure_refs\": [],\n      \"figures\": [],\n      \"source_text\": \"135. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示由下列不等式组给出的点的集合：а) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant0.64,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$б) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\geqslant4,\\\\\\\\x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant16;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$в) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant16,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant4-x;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$г) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant x^2,\\\\\\\\y-4&\\\\leqslant0.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": \"136\",\n      \"source_number\": \"136\",\n      \"group\": null,\n      \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n      \"text\": \"136. 图25中画细线条表示的都是由不等式组给出的点的集合，写出这些不等式组。\",\n      \"lines\": [\n        \"136. 图25中画细线条表示的都是由不等式组给出的点的集合，写出这些不等式组。\"\n      ],\n      \"pages\": [\n        \"p0062#4\"\n      ],\n      \"figure_refs\": [\n        \"fig-25\"\n      ],\n      \"figures\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fig-25\",\n          \"label\": \"图 25\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"136. 图25中画细线条表示的都是由不等式组给出的点的集合，写出这些不等式组.\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": \"137\",\n      \"source_number\": \"137\",\n      \"group\": \"复习题\",\n      \"group_id\": \"g1\",\n      \"text\": \"137.\\na) 两支徒步队从某地同时出发，一队向北，另一队向东。经过4小时后，两队之间的距离等于24公里，并且第一队比第二队多走了4.8公里。每一队行进的速度是多少？\\nb) 两个物体从直角顶点分别沿它的两条边同时开始移动，经过15秒后，它们之间的距离等于3米。已知第一个物体在6秒内通过的距离和第二个物体在8秒内通过的距离相同，每个物体移动的速度是多少？\",\n      \"lines\": [\n        \"137.\",\n        \"a) 两支徒步队从某地同时出发，一队向北，另一队向东。经过4小时后，两队之间的距离等于24公里，并且第一队比第二队多走了4.8公里。每一队行进的速度是多少？\",\n        \"b) 两个物体从直角顶点分别沿它的两条边同时开始移动，经过15秒后，它们之间的距离等于3米。已知第一个物体在6秒内通过的距离和第二个物体在8秒内通过的距离相同，每个物体移动的速度是多少？\"\n      ],\n      \"pages\": [\n        \"p0063#4\"\n      ],\n      \"figure_refs\": [],\n      \"figures\": [],\n      \"source_text\": \"137. а) 两个少先队中队从某地同时出发，一队向北，另一队向东. 经过4小时后，两队之间的距离等于24公里，并且第一队比第二队多走了4.8公里. 每一队行进的速度是多少？б) 两个物体从直角顶点分别沿它的两条边同时开始移动，经过15秒后，它们之间的距离等于3米. 已知第一个物体在6秒内通过的距离和第二个物体在8秒内通过的距离相同，每个物体移动的速度是多少？\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\",\n        \"culture\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"schema\": \"ld-s10y-lesson/edition-exercises@1\",\n  \"edition\": \"modern-us-neutral\",\n  \"status\": \"draft\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"path\": \"lessons/alg8-c2-s2-n10/exercises.json\",\n    \"sha256\": \"293abac76d7c8578707b4dc539fd04f315a14fbd7b0fa4f9feea1e12b18319a9\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"lesson\": \"alg8-c2-s2-n10\",\n      \"count\": 7,\n      \"exercises\": [\n        {\n          \"number\": \"131\",\n          \"source_number\": \"131\",\n          \"group\": null,\n          \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n          \"text\": \"131. 下列变量$x$和$y$的取值数对$(x,y)$是不等式组$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}2x+3y&>-1,\\\\\\\\x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant2\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$的解吗？а) $(0,0)$； б) $(-1,0.5)$； в) $(1,-1)$； г) $\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{3},1\\\\right)$.\",\n          \"lines\": [\n            \"131. 下列变量$x$和$y$的取值数对$(x,y)$是不等式组\",\n            \"$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}2x+3y&>-1,\\\\\\\\↵x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant2\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n            \"的解吗？\",\n            \"а) $(0,0)$； б) $(-1,0.5)$； в) $(1,-1)$； г) $\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{3},1\\\\right)$.\"\n          ],\n          \"pages\": [\n            \"p0061#7\"\n          ],\n          \"figure_refs\": [],\n          \"figures\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"number\": \"132\",\n          \"source_number\": \"132\",\n          \"group\": null,\n          \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n          \"text\": \"132. $F$是由不等式组$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\leqslant x+4,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant x-4\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$给出的坐标平面上点的集合，下列各点属于集合$F$吗？$A(0,5)$； $B(-1,3)$； $C(-20,20)$； $D(100,102)$.\",\n          \"lines\": [\n            \"132. $F$是由不等式组\",\n            \"$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\leqslant x+4,\\\\\\\\↵y&\\\\geqslant x-4\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n            \"给出的坐标平面上点的集合，下列各点属于集合$F$吗？\",\n            \"$A(0,5)$； $B(-1,3)$； $C(-20,20)$； $D(100,102)$.\"\n          ],\n          \"pages\": [\n            \"p0061#8\"\n          ],\n          \"figure_refs\": [],\n          \"figures\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"number\": \"133\",\n          \"source_number\": \"133\",\n          \"group\": null,\n          \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n          \"text\": \"133. 在坐标平面上画细线条表示下列各种点的集合：а) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\geqslant0,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$ б) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\geqslant2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant-1;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$в) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}2&\\\\leqslant x<4.5,\\\\\\\\1&\\\\leqslant y\\\\leqslant5;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$ г) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}-1&<x<2,\\\\\\\\-4&<y<-1.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n          \"lines\": [\n            \"133. 在坐标平面上画细线条表示下列各种点的集合：\",\n            \"а) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\geqslant0,\\\\\\\\↵y&\\\\leqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$ б) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\geqslant2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant-1;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n            \"в) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}2&\\\\leqslant x<4.5,\\\\\\\\↵1&\\\\leqslant y\\\\leqslant5;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$ г) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}-1&<x<2,\\\\\\\\-4&<y<-1.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\"\n          ],\n          \"pages\": [\n            \"p0061#9\",\n            \"p0062#1\"\n          ],\n          \"figure_refs\": [],\n          \"figures\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"number\": \"134\",\n          \"source_number\": \"134\",\n          \"group\": null,\n          \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n          \"text\": \"134. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示坐标满足下列不等式组的点的集合：а) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant2x+6,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant-2x+6;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$ б) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant x+2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant-x+2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant5;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$б) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y-3x-6&\\\\leqslant0,\\\\\\\\2y-6x+3&\\\\geqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$ г) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x+y&\\\\leqslant2,\\\\\\\\y-x&\\\\leqslant2,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant0.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n          \"lines\": [\n            \"134. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示坐标满足下列不等式组的\",\n            \"点的集合：\",\n            \"а) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant2x+6,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant-2x+6;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$ б) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant x+2,\\\\\\\\↵y&\\\\geqslant-x+2,\\\\\\\\↵y&\\\\leqslant5;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n            \"б) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y-3x-6&\\\\leqslant0,\\\\\\\\2y-6x+3&\\\\geqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$ г) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x+y&\\\\leqslant2,\\\\\\\\↵y-x&\\\\leqslant2,\\\\\\\\↵y&\\\\geqslant0.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\"\n          ],\n          \"pages\": [\n            \"p0062#2\"\n          ],\n          \"figure_refs\": [],\n          \"figures\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"number\": \"135\",\n          \"source_number\": \"135\",\n          \"group\": null,\n          \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n          \"text\": \"135. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示由下列不等式组给出的点的集合：а) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant0.64,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$б) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\geqslant4,\\\\\\\\x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant16;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$в) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant16,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant4-x;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$г) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant x^2,\\\\\\\\y-4&\\\\leqslant0.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n          \"lines\": [\n            \"135. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示由下列不等式组给出的点\",\n            \"的集合：\",\n            \"а) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant0.64,\\\\\\\\↵y&\\\\geqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n            \"б) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\geqslant4,\\\\\\\\↵x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant16;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n            \"в) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant16,\\\\\\\\↵y&\\\\geqslant4-x;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n            \"г) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant x^2,\\\\\\\\↵y-4&\\\\leqslant0.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\"\n          ],\n          \"pages\": [\n            \"p0062#3\"\n          ],\n          \"figure_refs\": [],\n          \"figures\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"number\": \"136\",\n          \"source_number\": \"136\",\n          \"group\": null,\n          \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n          \"text\": \"136. 图25中画细线条表示的都是由不等式组给出的点的集合，写出这些不等式组.\",\n          \"lines\": [\n            \"136. 图25中画细线条表示的都是由不等式组给出的点的集\",\n            \"合，写出这些不等式组.\"\n          ],\n          \"pages\": [\n            \"p0062#4\"\n          ],\n          \"figure_refs\": [\n            \"fig-25\"\n          ],\n          \"figures\": [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fig-25\",\n              \"label\": \"图 25\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"number\": \"137\",\n          \"source_number\": \"137\",\n          \"group\": \"复习题\",\n          \"group_id\": \"g1\",\n          \"text\": \"137. а) 两个少先队中队从某地同时出发，一队向北，另一队向东. 经过4小时后，两队之间的距离等于24公里，并且第一队比第二队多走了4.8公里. 每一队行进的速度是多少？б) 两个物体从直角顶点分别沿它的两条边同时开始移动，经过15秒后，它们之间的距离等于3米. 已知第一个物体在6秒内通过的距离和第二个物体在8秒内通过的距离相同，每个物体移动的速度是多少？\",\n          \"lines\": [\n            \"137. а) 两个少先队中队从某地同时出发，一队向北，另一队\",\n            \"向东. 经过4小时后，两队之间的距离等于24公里，并\",\n            \"且第一队比第二队多走了4.8公里. 每一队行进的速度\",\n            \"是多少？\",\n            \"б) 两个物体从直角顶点分别沿它的两条边同时开始移\",\n            \"动，经过15秒后，它们之间的距离等于3米. 已知第一\",\n            \"个物体在6秒内通过的距离和第二个物体在8秒内通\",\n            \"过的距离相同，每个物体移动的速度是多少？\"\n          ],\n          \"pages\": [\n            \"p0063#4\"\n          ],\n          \"figure_refs\": [],\n          \"figures\": []\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\n"}
{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3695/lemmadeck/.tmp/resume182-6-8a-n10-figure-context3695-FIRST/artifacts/8a/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg8-c2-s2-n10/figures.json","text":"{\n  \"schema\": \"ld-s10y-lesson/edition-figures@1\",\n  \"edition\": \"modern-us-neutral\",\n  \"lesson\": \"alg8-c2-s2-n10\",\n  \"status\": \"draft\",\n  \"figures\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fig-22\",\n      \"label\": \"图 22\",\n      \"spec\": \"figures/fig-22.spec.json\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"modernized\"\n      ],\n      \"source\": {\n        \"png\": {\n          \"path\": \"figures/fig-22.png\",\n          \"sha256\": \"45fe3024c4f17df6c2bced17e809e116dc74c0dc6ca569f8d181362538a753af\"\n        },\n        \"svg\": {\n          \"path\": \"figures/fig-22.svg\",\n          \"sha256\": \"a7101a4e839b6decd2ef40f3b9575dd4c4cf9c6109870b83137c460d47145f09\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fig-23\",\n      \"label\": \"图 23\",\n      \"spec\": \"figures/fig-23.spec.json\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"modernized\"\n      ],\n      \"source\": {\n        \"png\": {\n          \"path\": \"figures/fig-23.png\",\n          \"sha256\": \"ee6c3df6bd43b48df8fa006dbd23478e47ba66fe2dd2d248da7c4699d371ad31\"\n        },\n        \"svg\": {\n          \"path\": \"figures/fig-23.svg\",\n          \"sha256\": \"a951a97fd4def7b94a41e4067557a8a3fc5c040cd1b215acd261cc018e4a0499\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fig-24\",\n      \"label\": \"图 24\",\n      \"spec\": \"figures/fig-24.spec.json\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"modernized\"\n      ],\n      \"source\": {\n        \"png\": {\n          \"path\": \"figures/fig-24.png\",\n          \"sha256\": \"bc88e91a7d714f7cb7b821aebb23daf9de6772ffe5786ca6368649c14c006fa2\"\n        },\n        \"svg\": {\n          \"path\": \"figures/fig-24.svg\",\n          \"sha256\": \"3d99aeefa5fd5071661b5ad645bf267797707f1388a7b41b7e6348d73a568a8d\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fig-25\",\n      \"label\": \"图 25\",\n      \"spec\": \"figures/fig-25.spec.json\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"modernized\"\n      ],\n      \"source\": {\n        \"png\": {\n          \"path\": \"figures/fig-25.png\",\n          \"sha256\": \"c6982988a8fa79b1d62fec64a7027bf125c8535cd6ee0daa6cc86ad074b62e33\"\n        },\n        \"svg\": {\n          \"path\": \"figures/fig-25.svg\",\n          \"sha256\": \"e9ca4bf69a986c79d0aa4b8464d30af1422be2f5f4692a2684dc0bca69335ac0\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}
{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3695/lemmadeck/.tmp/resume182-6-8a-n10-figure-context3695-FIRST/artifacts/8a/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg8-c2-s2-n10/lesson.json","text":"{\n  \"id\": \"alg8-c2-s2-n10\",\n  \"card_id\": \"alg8-c2-s2-n10\",\n  \"chapter\": \"第二章　二元方程和二元不等式\",\n  \"section\": \"§4. 二元不等式和二元不等式组\",\n  \"number\": \"10\",\n  \"title\": \"二元不等式组\",\n  \"printed_title\": \"10. 二元不等式组\",\n  \"start_page\": 60,\n  \"start_printed\": 53,\n  \"figures\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fig-22\",\n      \"label\": \"图 22\",\n      \"page\": 60\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fig-23\",\n      \"label\": \"图 23\",\n      \"page\": 61\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fig-24\",\n      \"label\": \"图 24\",\n      \"page\": 61\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fig-25\",\n      \"label\": \"图 25\",\n      \"page\": 63\n    }\n  ],\n  \"exercise_count\": 7,\n  \"prose\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"p\",\n      \"text\": \"我们来讨论二元不等式组：\\n$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant x,\\\\\\\\x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant9.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n      \"id\": null,\n      \"label\": null,\n      \"printed_page\": 53,\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"p0060#2\"\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"我们来讨论二元不等式组：$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant x,\\\\\\\\x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant9.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"p\",\n      \"text\": \"这个不等式组的解集合是其中各不等式的解集合的交集。\",\n      \"id\": null,\n      \"label\": null,\n      \"printed_page\": 53,\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"p0060#3\"\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"这个不等式组的解集合是其中各不等式的解集合的交集.\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"p\",\n      \"text\": \"我们来看看，以所讨论的不等式组的解为坐标的平面上点的集合是什么。\",\n      \"id\": null,\n      \"label\": null,\n      \"printed_page\": 53,\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"p0060#4\"\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"我们来看看，以所讨论的不等式组的解为坐标的平面上点的集合是什么.\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"p\",\n      \"text\": \"坐标满足不等式$y\\\\geqslant x$的点的集合，是直线$y=x$上的点的集合与这条直线上方的开半平面上的点的集合的并集（图22中用水平细线表示）。\\n坐标满足不等式$x^2+y^2\\\\leqslant9$的点的集合，是圆心在坐标原点、半径为3的圆形区域，包含内部和边界（图22中用铅直细线表示）。\\n\\n一个点的坐标满足这个不等式组，当且仅当这个点属于这两个点集的交集。\\n图22中，两种细线重叠的区域就是这两个点集的交集。\\n这就是说，所讨论的不等式组给出一个包含内部和边界的半圆形区域。\",\n      \"id\": null,\n      \"label\": null,\n      \"printed_page\": 53,\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"p0060#5\",\n        \"p0060#8\"\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"坐标满足不等式$y\\\\geqslant x$的点的集合，是直线$y=x$上和位于这条直线上方的开半平面上点的集合的并集（在图22中，这个集合画水平的细线表示）. 坐标满足不等式$x^2+y^2\\\\leqslant9$的点的集合是圆心在坐标原点、半径为3的圆（在图22中，这个集合画铅直的细线表示）. 显然，属于由不等式组中每个不等式给出的点的集合的交集的这些点的坐标，并且只有这些点的坐标，才能满足不等式组（在图22中，和这个交集对应的是一种细线条画在另一种细线条上面的区域）. 这就是说，所讨论的不等式组给出半圆.\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\",\n        \"clarification\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"fig\",\n      \"text\": \"\",\n      \"id\": \"fig-22\",\n      \"label\": \"图 22\",\n      \"printed_page\": 53,\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"p0060#6\"\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"\",\n      \"changes\": [],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"cap\",\n      \"text\": \"图 22\",\n      \"id\": null,\n      \"label\": \"图 22\",\n      \"printed_page\": 53,\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"p0060#7\"\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"图 22\",\n      \"changes\": [],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"p\",\n      \"text\": \"我们再举两个例子。\",\n      \"id\": null,\n      \"label\": null,\n      \"printed_page\": 53,\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"p0060#9\"\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"我们再举两个例子.\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"p\",\n      \"text\": \"例1：考察不等式组：\\n$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\leqslant0,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant0\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\n它给出第二象限及其在坐标轴上的边界，包含坐标原点（图23）。\",\n      \"id\": null,\n      \"label\": null,\n      \"printed_page\": 53,\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"p0060#10\",\n        \"p0061#1\"\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"例1 不等式组$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\leqslant0,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant0\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$给出第二象限（图23）.\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\",\n        \"clarification\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"fig\",\n      \"text\": \"\",\n      \"id\": \"fig-23\",\n      \"label\": \"图 23\",\n      \"printed_page\": 54,\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"p0061#2\"\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"\",\n      \"changes\": [],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"cap\",\n      \"text\": \"图 23\",\n      \"id\": null,\n      \"label\": \"图 23\",\n      \"printed_page\": 54,\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"p0061#3\"\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"图 23\",\n      \"changes\": [],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"fig\",\n      \"text\": \"\",\n      \"id\": \"fig-24\",\n      \"label\": \"图 24\",\n      \"printed_page\": 54,\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"p0061#4\"\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"\",\n      \"changes\": [],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"cap\",\n      \"text\": \"图 24\",\n      \"id\": null,\n      \"label\": \"图 24\",\n      \"printed_page\": 54,\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"p0061#5\"\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"图 24\",\n      \"changes\": [],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"p\",\n      \"text\": \"例2：考察不等式组：\\n$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant2x-3,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant2x+2\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\n它给出以直线$y=2x-3$和$y=2x+2$为边界的带形区域，包含两条边界直线（图24）。\",\n      \"id\": null,\n      \"label\": null,\n      \"printed_page\": 54,\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"p0061#6\"\n      ],\n      \"source_text\": \"例2 不等式组$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant2x-3,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant2x+2\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$给出由直线$y=2x-3$和$y=2x+2$为边界的带（图24）.\",\n      \"changes\": [\n        \"layout\",\n        \"clarification\"\n      ],\n      \"numeric_changes\": [],\n      \"historical_entities\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"schema\": \"ld-s10y-lesson/edition-lesson@1\",\n  \"edition\": \"modern-us-neutral\",\n  \"status\": \"draft\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"path\": \"lessons/alg8-c2-s2-n10/lesson.json\",\n    \"sha256\": \"8be6afcb95fbdbc9df16eb2113ea4ff8e6aac55228fdb2a45ef3e816c7190770\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"id\": \"alg8-c2-s2-n10\",\n      \"card_id\": \"alg8-c2-s2-n10\",\n      \"chapter\": \"第二章　二元方程和二元不等式\",\n      \"section\": \"§4. 二元不等式和二元不等式组\",\n      \"number\": \"10\",\n      \"title\": \"二元不等式组\",\n      \"printed_title\": \"10. 二元不等式组\",\n      \"start_page\": 60,\n      \"start_printed\": 53,\n      \"figures\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fig-22\",\n          \"label\": \"图 22\",\n          \"page\": 60\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fig-23\",\n          \"label\": \"图 23\",\n          \"page\": 61\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fig-24\",\n          \"label\": \"图 24\",\n          \"page\": 61\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fig-25\",\n          \"label\": \"图 25\",\n          \"page\": 63\n        }\n      ],\n      \"exercise_count\": 7,\n      \"prose\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"p\",\n          \"text\": \"我们来讨论二元不等式组：$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant x,\\\\\\\\x^2+y^2&\\\\leqslant9.\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n          \"id\": null,\n          \"label\": null,\n          \"printed_page\": 53,\n          \"source_refs\": [\n            \"p0060#2\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"p\",\n          \"text\": \"这个不等式组的解集合是其中各不等式的解集合的交集.\",\n          \"id\": null,\n          \"label\": null,\n          \"printed_page\": 53,\n          \"source_refs\": [\n            \"p0060#3\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"p\",\n          \"text\": \"我们来看看，以所讨论的不等式组的解为坐标的平面上点的集合是什么.\",\n          \"id\": null,\n          \"label\": null,\n          \"printed_page\": 53,\n          \"source_refs\": [\n            \"p0060#4\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"p\",\n          \"text\": \"坐标满足不等式$y\\\\geqslant x$的点的集合，是直线$y=x$上和位于这条直线上方的开半平面上点的集合的并集（在图22中，这个集合画水平的细线表示）. 坐标满足不等式$x^2+y^2\\\\leqslant9$的点的集合是圆心在坐标原点、半径为3的圆（在图22中，这个集合画铅直的细线表示）. 显然，属于由不等式组中每个不等式给出的点的集合的交集的这些点的坐标，并且只有这些点的坐标，才能满足不等式组（在图22中，和这个交集对应的是一种细线条画在另一种细线条上面的区域）. 这就是说，所讨论的不等式组给出半圆.\",\n          \"id\": null,\n          \"label\": null,\n          \"printed_page\": 53,\n          \"source_refs\": [\n            \"p0060#5\",\n            \"p0060#8\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"fig\",\n          \"text\": \"\",\n          \"id\": \"fig-22\",\n          \"label\": \"图 22\",\n          \"printed_page\": 53,\n          \"source_refs\": [\n            \"p0060#6\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"cap\",\n          \"text\": \"图 22\",\n          \"id\": null,\n          \"label\": \"图 22\",\n          \"printed_page\": 53,\n          \"source_refs\": [\n            \"p0060#7\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"p\",\n          \"text\": \"我们再举两个例子.\",\n          \"id\": null,\n          \"label\": null,\n          \"printed_page\": 53,\n          \"source_refs\": [\n            \"p0060#9\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"p\",\n          \"text\": \"例1 不等式组$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\leqslant0,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant0\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$给出第二象限（图23）.\",\n          \"id\": null,\n          \"label\": null,\n          \"printed_page\": 53,\n          \"source_refs\": [\n            \"p0060#10\",\n            \"p0061#1\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"fig\",\n          \"text\": \"\",\n          \"id\": \"fig-23\",\n          \"label\": \"图 23\",\n          \"printed_page\": 54,\n          \"source_refs\": [\n            \"p0061#2\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"cap\",\n          \"text\": \"图 23\",\n          \"id\": null,\n          \"label\": \"图 23\",\n          \"printed_page\": 54,\n          \"source_refs\": [\n            \"p0061#3\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"fig\",\n          \"text\": \"\",\n          \"id\": \"fig-24\",\n          \"label\": \"图 24\",\n          \"printed_page\": 54,\n          \"source_refs\": [\n            \"p0061#4\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"cap\",\n          \"text\": \"图 24\",\n          \"id\": null,\n          \"label\": \"图 24\",\n          \"printed_page\": 54,\n          \"source_refs\": [\n            \"p0061#5\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"p\",\n          \"text\": \"例2 不等式组$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant2x-3,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant2x+2\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$给出由直线$y=2x-3$和$y=2x+2$为边界的带（图24）.\",\n          \"id\": null,\n          \"label\": null,\n          \"printed_page\": 54,\n          \"source_refs\": [\n            \"p0061#6\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"section_breaks\": [\n    {\n      \"before\": \"这个不等式组的解集合是其中各不等式的解集合的交集。\",\n      \"after\": \"我们来看看，以所讨论的不等式组的解为坐标的平面上点的集合是什么。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"before\": \"一个点的坐标满足这个不等式组，当且仅当这个点属于这两个点集的交集。\\n图22中，两种细线重叠的区域就是这两个点集的交集。\\n这就是说，所讨论的不等式组给出一个包含内部和边界的半圆形区域。\",\n      \"after\": \"我们再举两个例子。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"before\": \"例1：考察不等式组：\\n$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}x&\\\\leqslant0,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\geqslant0\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\n它给出第二象限及其在坐标轴上的边界，包含坐标原点（图23）。\",\n      \"after\": \"例2：考察不等式组：\\n$\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y&\\\\geqslant2x-3,\\\\\\\\y&\\\\leqslant2x+2\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\\n它给出以直线$y=2x-3$和$y=2x+2$为边界的带形区域，包含两条边界直线（图24）。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"errata\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p0062-ex134-label-3\",\n      \"target\": \"exercises[3]\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"page\": 62,\n        \"printed_page\": 55,\n        \"block\": \"p0062#2\",\n        \"sha256\": \"2f649252e5773a82668d7b5a0c1e1235cb8f4dc7a5626f866d4bf02eea58ece2\",\n        \"pdf_sha256\": \"5978388efc80df4085400f80d5912f710efb052a806222633b172b0a9479b071\"\n      },\n      \"original\": \"б) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y-3x-6&\\\\leqslant0,\\\\\\\\2y-6x+3&\\\\geqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n      \"corrected\": \"c) $\\\\left\\\\{\\\\begin{aligned}y-3x-6&\\\\leqslant0,\\\\\\\\2y-6x+3&\\\\geqslant0;\\\\end{aligned}\\\\right.$\",\n      \"reason\": \"独立原生源审确认四项印刷标号为а、б、б、г；完整左下系统唯一绑定第三项重复б，现代层应按第三序位c)标记，只修标号，不改两式或题号134。原页仍保留印刷б。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}
